           "buyer's book before the deal; with no counterparty half that holds on the seller's history, a deal above "
           "T0 is NO or LIMIT; halves from keys under the seller's controller declaration are not claims held; an "
           "adjudication against the seller is never ignored")
PINNED = ["capsulectl", "capsulectl-book"]
LIVE_PINNED = ["capsules", "mesh-llm", "mesh-llm-pr-2620"]
